  extends: "DSN-COUPLE-01 (manifest → attestation); connection_schema.json; coupling.rs; PSI/1.0 (task O)",

  thesis: "integrate ⟸ presenting a VERIFIABLE VIABILITY GUARANTEE, ¬a
