      bindings ▪ Ω box ▪ trust state (4-axis) ▪ S1..S5 completeness ▪ nonce",
    signed: "Ed25519 over certifier identity (covenant key chain). parent verifies
      (a) the signature ▪ (b) CERTIFIER BINARY sha = canonical minimal-nucleus
